## 🏗️ **CURRENT ARCHITECTURE STATUS**

### **Frontend (SwiftUI) - ✅ COMPLETE**
- **Dashboard**: Main interface with project overview and quick actions
- **Projects Sidebar**: Project management and navigation
- **Context Management**: UI for managing context sources and packs
- **Power Mode**: AI enhancement profile interface (not connected to backend)
- **Settings**: Configuration and customization interfaces

### **Backend (New Architecture) - ⚠️ IMPLEMENTED BUT NOT CONNECTED**
- **ProjectRegistry**: Central project management (✅ IMPLEMENTED)
- **IngestionOrchestrator**: Job scheduling and execution (✅ IMPLEMENTED)
- **SourcePlugin Protocol**: Plugin interface definition (✅ IMPLEMENTED)
- **EnhancedContextAssemblyService**: Context composition (✅ IMPLEMENTED)
- **ChatStreamService**: Real-time chat integration (✅ IMPLEMENTED)
- **CredentialStore**: Credential management (✅ IMPLEMENTED)

### **Data Layer (SwiftData) - ✅ WORKING**
- **Models**: Project, ContextSource, ContextPack, DictionaryEntry, etc.
- **Persistence**: SwiftData container with content-addressable storage
- **Migration**: Handles schema evolution with automatic reset mechanism

